@startuml
title Verify OTP Sequence (/api/auth/otp/verify)
autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
actor Guest
boundary "OtpScreen UI" as OtpScreen
entity "OtpVerifyRequest\n(BE Request DTO)" as OtpVerifyRequestDto
entity "OtpVerifyResponse\n(BE Response DTO)" as OtpVerifyResponseDto
control "AuthController" as AuthController
control "IAuthService" as IAuthService
control "AuthService" as AuthService
entity "OtpVerification" as OtpEntity
control "IOtpRepository" as IOtpRepository
control "OtpRepository" as OtpRepository
database "VocaNovaDbContext" as DbContext
database "MySQL Database" as MySQL
note over OtpScreen, MySQL
Current code has OTP verification by phone.
OtpVerifyRequest and OtpVerifyResponse exist in API Contracts.
No separate verify-email flow was found in Auth code.
Interfaces used in code: IAuthService, IOtpRepository.
end note
Guest -> OtpScreen: Enter OTP code
Guest -> OtpScreen: Click Verify button
OtpScreen -> OtpScreen: Validate OTP input
alt Data input invalid
OtpScreen --> Guest: Show error message
else Data input valid
OtpScreen -> OtpVerifyRequestDto: Create request data(phone, otp_code)
OtpVerifyRequestDto -> AuthController: POST /api/auth/otp/verifyOtpVerifyRequest
AuthController -> AuthController: Validate OtpVerifyRequest
alt Request validation fails
AuthController --> OtpScreen: HTTP 400 error
OtpScreen --> Guest: Show error message
else Request validation success
AuthController -> IAuthService: VerifyOtpAsync(otp data)
IAuthService -> AuthService: VerifyOtpAsync(otp data)
AuthService -> IOtpRepository: FindLatestAsync(phone, userId=null)
IOtpRepository -> OtpRepository: FindLatestAsync(phone, userId=null)
OtpRepository -> DbContext: Query latest active OTP
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT latest OTP
MySQL --> DbContext: OTP row or null
DbContext -> OtpEntity: Materialize OtpVerification?
OtpEntity --> DbContext: OtpVerification or null
DbContext --> OtpRepository: Result
OtpRepository --> AuthService: OtpRecord or null
alt OTP missing or expired
AuthService --> AuthController: Unauthorized result
AuthController --> OtpScreen: HTTP 401 error
OtpScreen --> Guest: Show error message
else OTP already used
AuthService --> AuthController: Conflict result
AuthController --> OtpScreen: HTTP 409 error
OtpScreen --> Guest: Show error message
else Too many verify attempts
AuthService --> AuthController: TooManyRequests result
AuthController --> OtpScreen: HTTP 429 error
OtpScreen --> Guest: Show error message
else OTP code is wrong
AuthService -> IOtpRepository: StageAttemptAsync(otpId, attempt + 1)
IOtpRepository -> OtpRepository: StageAttemptAsync(otpId, attempt + 1)
OtpRepository -> OtpEntity: Increment AttemptCount
OtpEntity --> OtpRepository: OtpVerification updated
OtpRepository -> DbContext: Track OTP attempt
DbContext -> MySQL: UPDATE otp_verifications
MySQL --> DbContext: Update result
DbContext --> OtpRepository: Save result
OtpRepository --> AuthService: Attempt saved
AuthService --> AuthController: Unauthorized result
AuthController --> OtpScreen: HTTP 401 Invalid OTP
OtpScreen --> Guest: Show error message
else OTP valid
AuthService -> IOtpRepository: StageUsedAsync(otp, userId=null)
IOtpRepository -> OtpRepository: StageUsedAsync(otp, userId=null)
OtpRepository -> OtpEntity: Set UsedAt
OtpEntity --> OtpRepository: OtpVerification updated
OtpRepository -> DbContext: Track OTP used
DbContext -> MySQL: UPDATE otp_verifications
MySQL --> DbContext: Update result
DbContext --> OtpRepository: Save result
OtpRepository --> AuthService: OTP verified
AuthService --> AuthController: Return verify result
AuthController -> OtpVerifyResponseDto: Create response data(verified)
OtpVerifyResponseDto --> OtpScreen: HTTP 200 OK\nOtpVerifyResponse
OtpScreen --> Guest: Show success message
end
end
end
@enduml
